      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KNIGHT'S CASTLE (6) is super consistent overall, having placed 26 of 54 career runs. Finished in the minors latest when third (17.48) at Taree Super Track and may be close to breaking through. Form at the trip sound including six wins. Likely to feature again. MARVIN MONELLI (1) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Gunnedah over 340m behind Kiando Venom (20.06) in a Grade 5. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Key runner on best form. DON'T DO IT (2) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 12 lengths sixth (23.76) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 400m. Has the ability and looks a key chance. I'M ALRIGHT (3) generally performs well here at this distance.",
